  "cle": "cote-des-bar",
  "contenu": {
    "_type": "localeRichText",
    "en": [
      {
        "_key": "t17",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t16",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A vineyard in the south of Champagne"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t1f",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t18",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The Côte des Bar is the southernmost part of the Champagne vineyard. Its slopes are organised around two small towns, Bar-sur-Seine and Bar-sur-Aube. Together with "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t1a",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t19"
            ],
            "text": "Montgueux"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t1b",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t1d",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t1c"
            ],
            "text": "Villenauxe-la-Grande"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t1e",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", it makes up the Aube vineyard: around 8,000 hectares, more than a fifth of the vineyard."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t19",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/en/montgueux/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t1c",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/en/villenauxe-la-grande/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t1h",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t1g",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Pinot noir country"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t1j",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t1i",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Here, pinot noir covers more than 80% of the vines. On Kimmeridgian marl it gives generous champagnes, often made as blanc de noirs. Chardonnay and meunier complete the picture. The Côte des Bar also keeps most of Champagne's rare grape varieties: pinot blanc, pinot gris, known here as fromenteau, arbane and petit meslier. Winemakers in Buxeuil and Urville saved them from oblivion. Chardonnay rose, a natural mutation of chardonnay, joined the list of permitted varieties in 2025."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t1l",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t1k",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A story of resistance"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t1q",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t1m",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "In 1911, the winemakers of the Aube mobilised against their exclusion from the Champagne appellation. The law of 28 July 1927 gave them back their place. Today, many independent winemakers work in the Côte des Bar, some of them in "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t1o",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t1n"
            ],
            "text": "our selection"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t1p",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t1n",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/en/winemakers/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t1s",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t1r",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "On the Champagne Route"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t1u",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t1t",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The Champagne Tourist Route crosses the Côte des Bar for around 220 kilometres, starting from Bar-sur-Seine or Bar-sur-Aube. In Essoyes, where Renoir spent nearly thirty summers, you can visit the painter's studio. In Colombey-les-Deux-Églises, the Charles de Gaulle Memorial recalls another chapter of history."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t1w",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t1v",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Taste this terroir"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t27",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t1x",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The best way to understand this terroir is to taste it with the people who farm it. Join one of "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t1z",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t1y"
            ],
            "text": "our tastings"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t20",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", in Troyes or at your home, or discover "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t22",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t21"
            ],
            "text": "our selection"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t23",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ". Are you a restaurant, wine shop or hotel? Discover "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t25",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t24"
            ],
            "text": "our trade offer"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t26",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t1y",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/en/tasting-troyes/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t21",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/en/winemakers/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t24",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/en/champagne-for-hotels-restaurants-and-wine-shops/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      }
    ],
    "fr": [
      {
        "_key": "t5",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t4",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Un vignoble au sud de la Champagne"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "td",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t6",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "La Côte des Bar est la partie la plus méridionale du vignoble champenois. Ses coteaux s'organisent autour de deux petites villes, Bar-sur-Seine et Bar-sur-Aube. Avec "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t8",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t7"
            ],
            "text": "Montgueux"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t9",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " et "
          },
          {
            "_key": "tb",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "ta"
            ],
            "text": "Villenauxe-la-Grande"
          },
          {
            "_key": "tc",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", elle forme le vignoble de l'Aube : environ 8 000 hectares, soit plus d'un cinquième du vignoble."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t7",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/montgueux/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "ta",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/villenauxe-la-grande/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "tf",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "te",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Le pays du pinot noir"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "th",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "tg",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Ici, le pinot noir couvre plus de 80 % des vignes. Sur les marnes kimméridgiennes, il donne des champagnes généreux, souvent vinifiés en blanc de noirs. Le chardonnay et le meunier complètent l'encépagement. La Côte des Bar garde aussi l'essentiel des cépages rares de la Champagne : le pinot blanc, le pinot gris, que l'on appelle ici fromenteau, l'arbane et le petit meslier. Des vignerons de Buxeuil ou d'Urville les ont sauvés de l'oubli. Le chardonnay rose, mutation naturelle du chardonnay, a rejoint en 2025 la liste des cépages autorisés."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "tj",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "ti",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Une histoire de résistance"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "to",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "tk",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "En 1911, les vignerons de l'Aube se mobilisent contre leur exclusion de l'appellation Champagne. La loi du 28 juillet 1927 leur rend leur place. Aujourd'hui, de nombreux vignerons indépendants travaillent dans la Côte des Bar, dont certains de "
          },
          {
            "_key": "tm",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "tl"
            ],
            "text": "notre sélection"
          },
          {
            "_key": "tn",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "tl",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/vignerons/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "tq",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "tp",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Sur la Route du Champagne"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "ts",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "tr",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "La Route touristique du Champagne parcourt la Côte des Bar sur environ 220 kilomètres, au départ de Bar-sur-Seine ou de Bar-sur-Aube. À Essoyes, où Renoir a passé près de trente étés, l'atelier du peintre se visite. À Colombey-les-Deux-Églises, le Mémorial Charles de Gaulle rappelle une autre page d'histoire."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "tu",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "tt",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Goûter ce terroir"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t15",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "tv",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Le meilleur moyen de comprendre ce terroir, c'est de le goûter avec ceux qui le cultivent. Rejoignez l'une de "
          },
          {
            "_key": "tx",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "tw"
            ],
            "text": "nos dégustations"
          },
          {
            "_key": "ty",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", à Troyes ou chez vous, ou découvrez "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t10",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "tz"
            ],
            "text": "notre sélection"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t11",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ". Vous êtes restaurateur, caviste ou hôtelier ? Découvrez "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t13",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t12"
            ],
            "text": "notre offre pro"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t14",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "tw",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/tasting-troyes/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "tz",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/vignerons/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t12",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/champagne-hotel-restaurants-et-cavistes/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      }
    ],
    "it": [
      {
        "_key": "t3b",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t3a",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Un vigneto nel sud della Champagne"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t3j",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t3c",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "La Côte des Bar è la parte più meridionale del vigneto champenois. Le sue colline si organizzano attorno a due cittadine, Bar-sur-Seine e Bar-sur-Aube. Con "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t3e",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t3d"
            ],
            "text": "Montgueux"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t3f",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " e "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t3h",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t3g"
            ],
            "text": "Villenauxe-la-Grande"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t3i",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", forma il vigneto dell'Aube: circa 8.000 ettari, un buon quarto della Champagne."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t3d",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/it/montgueux/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t3g",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/it/villenauxe-la-grande/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t3l",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t3k",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Il paese del pinot noir"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t3n",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t3m",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Qui il pinot noir copre oltre l'80% delle vigne. Sulle marne kimmeridgiane dà champagne generosi, spesso vinificati in blanc de noirs. Chardonnay e meunier completano l'uvaggio. La Côte des Bar conserva anche la maggior parte dei vitigni rari della Champagne: pinot blanc, pinot gris, qui chiamato fromenteau, arbane e petit meslier. Vignaioli di Buxeuil e Urville li hanno salvati dall'oblio. Lo chardonnay rose, mutazione naturale dello chardonnay, è entrato nel 2025 nell'elenco dei vitigni ammessi."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t3p",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t3o",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Una storia di resistenza"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t3u",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t3q",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Nel 1911 i vignaioli dell'Aube si mobilitarono contro la loro esclusione dalla denominazione Champagne. La legge del 28 luglio 1927 restituì loro il loro posto. Oggi molti vignaioli indipendenti lavorano nella Côte des Bar, alcuni della "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t3s",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t3r"
            ],
            "text": "nostra selezione"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t3t",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t3r",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/it/vignaioli/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t3w",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t3v",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Sulla Strada dello Champagne"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t3y",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t3x",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "La Strada turistica dello Champagne attraversa la Côte des Bar per circa 220 chilometri, partendo da Bar-sur-Seine o da Bar-sur-Aube. A Essoyes, dove Renoir trascorse quasi trenta estati, si visita l'atelier del pittore. A Colombey-les-Deux-Églises, il Memoriale Charles de Gaulle ricorda un'altra pagina di storia."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t40",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t3z",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Assaggiare questo terroir"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t4b",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t41",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Il modo migliore per capire questo terroir è assaggiarlo con chi lo coltiva. Partecipate a una delle "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t43",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t42"
            ],
            "text": "nostre degustazioni"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t44",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", a Troyes o a casa vostra, oppure scoprite "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t46",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t45"
            ],
            "text": "la nostra selezione"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t47",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ". Siete ristoratori, enotecari o albergatori? Scoprite "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t49",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t48"
            ],
            "text": "la nostra offerta per professionisti"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t4a",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
