    "nl": [
      {
        "_key": "t29",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t28",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Een wijngaard in het zuiden van de Champagne"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t2h",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t2a",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "De Côte des Bar is het zuidelijkste deel van de Champagne-wijngaard. De hellingen liggen rond twee stadjes, Bar-sur-Seine en Bar-sur-Aube. Samen met "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t2c",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t2b"
            ],
            "text": "Montgueux"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t2d",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " en "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t2f",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t2e"
            ],
            "text": "Villenauxe-la-Grande"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t2g",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " vormt ze de wijngaard van de Aube: zo'n 8.000 hectare, een flink kwart van de Champagne."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t2b",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/nl/montgueux/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t2e",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/nl/villenauxe-la-grande/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t2j",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t2i",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Het land van de pinot noir"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t2l",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t2k",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Hier beslaat pinot noir meer dan 80% van de wijngaarden. Op kimmeridgiaanse mergel geeft hij royale champagnes, vaak als blanc de noirs. Chardonnay en meunier vullen het geheel aan. De Côte des Bar bewaart ook de meeste zeldzame druivenrassen van de Champagne: pinot blanc, pinot gris, hier fromenteau genoemd, arbane en petit meslier. Wijnmakers in Buxeuil en Urville hebben ze van de vergetelheid gered. Chardonnay rose, een natuurlijke mutatie van chardonnay, kwam in 2025 op de lijst van toegestane rassen."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t2n",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t2m",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Een verhaal van verzet"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t2s",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t2o",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "In 1911 kwamen de wijnmakers van de Aube in verzet tegen hun uitsluiting uit de appellatie Champagne. De wet van 28 juli 1927 gaf hun hun plaats terug. Vandaag werken veel onafhankelijke wijnmakers in de Côte des Bar, sommigen uit "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t2q",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t2p"
            ],
            "text": "onze selectie"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t2r",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t2p",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/nl/wijnmakers/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t2u",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t2t",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Op de Champagneroute"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t2w",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t2v",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "De toeristische Champagneroute doorkruist de Côte des Bar over zo'n 220 kilometer, vanuit Bar-sur-Seine of Bar-sur-Aube. In Essoyes, waar Renoir bijna dertig zomers doorbracht, kunt u het atelier van de schilder bezoeken. In Colombey-les-Deux-Églises herinnert het Mémorial Charles de Gaulle aan een ander stuk geschiedenis."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t2y",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t2x",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Dit terroir proeven"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "t39",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "t2z",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "De beste manier om dit terroir te begrijpen, is het te proeven met wie het bewerkt. Kom naar een van "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t31",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t30"
            ],
            "text": "onze proeverijen"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t32",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ", in Troyes of bij u thuis, of ontdek "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t34",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t33"
            ],
            "text": "onze selectie"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t35",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": ". Bent u restaurateur, wijnhandelaar of hotelier? Ontdek "
          },
          {
            "_key": "t37",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "t36"
            ],
            "text": "ons aanbod voor professionals"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t38",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [
          {
            "_key": "t30",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/nl/tasting-troyes/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t33",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/nl/wijnmakers/"
          },
          {
            "_key": "t36",
            "_type": "link",
            "href": "/nl/champagne-voor-hotels-restaurants-en-wijnhandels/"
          }
        ],
        "style": "normal"
      }
    ]
  },
